        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Yum China Holdings Inc., Yum! Brands, Tricon Global Restaurants, Inc.\n- Places: United States, Plano, Texas, Shanghai\n- Topics: Fortune 500, corporate spin-offs, workforce size, fast-food industry\n\nFacts:\n- Yum! Brands, Inc., formerly Tricon Global Restaurants, Inc., is an American fast-food company.\n- Yum China Holdings Inc. was spun off from Yum! Brands in 2016.\n- Yum China Holdings Inc. is a Fortune 500 fast-food restaurant company incorporated in the United States.\n- Yum China Holdings Inc. has joint headquarters in Plano, Texas, and Shanghai.\n- Yum China Holdings Inc. has 420,000 employees, giving it the third-largest workforce among all U.S. companies worldwide.",
